# Testing

- Unit tests: Vitest under `src/**/__tests__/` or `*.test.ts`.
- No network in default unit tests.
- Prefer testing `Array2D`, expr, params compress/round-trip, and future GridRuledLines math.
- Name cases with requirement IDs when useful (`VIZ-02`).
- Commands from `quatricmorph/`: `npm test`, `npm run test:watch`, `npm run build`.
- Do not require WebGL in unit tests.
